{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想準確掌握距離重要日子還有多久，Countdown 可把倒數細分至星期、日、小時、分鐘與秒數，適合需要追蹤生日、紀念日或項目截止時間的用家。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，並提供無廣告的使用體驗。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-22.webp\">\n<h2>倒數計時與通知提醒</h2>\n<p>Countdown 除了計算剩餘日數，亦細分至小時、分鐘與秒數，讓用家清楚掌握距離生日、紀念日或截止時間尚有多少。程式支援無限個倒數事件，並以本地通知提醒，避免錯過任何安排。內置多款背景圖片，可自行配搭出順眼的介面風格。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2208bb.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2208bb-1.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2208bb-2.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2208bb-3.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2208bb-4.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Countdown – Weeks, Days, Hours, Minutes and Seconds Counter</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:59:51.278359+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:46:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T05:57:43.985092+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:57:40.881589+00:00","content_hash":"d3658ade9d9fc3feb953c97e3d4e649700bd52a99c8d471f0a9604c5be292aba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}